+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// Native async subprocess + fd seam (Phase K). Generalizes the socket watch
+// list / job-queue poll loop above to arbitrary fds (pipes) and child reaping,
+// using only existing POSIX syscalls (posix_spawn/pipe/waitpid/kill/read/write/
+// chdir via file-actions). ABI-neutral: no new syscall number or marshalling.
